//arxiv.org/abs/2107.05720" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.05720</a></li><li>ColBERT：Khattab &amp; Zaharia，<em>ColBERT: Efficient and Effective Passage Search via Contextualized Late Interaction over BERT</em>（SIGIR 2020）— <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.12832" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2004.12832</a></li><li>HyDE：Gao、Ma、Lin、Callan，<em>Precise Zero-Shot Dense Retrieval without Relevance Labels</em> — <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2212.10496" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2212.10496</a></li><li>BEIR：Thakur 等，<em>BEIR: A Heterogenous Benchmark for Zero-shot Evaluation of Information Retrieval Models</em>（NeurIPS 2021 Datasets and Benchmarks）— <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.08663" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.08663</a></li><li>MTEB：Muennighoff 等，<em>MTEB: Massive Text Embedding Benchmark</em> — <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.07316" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.07316</a></li><li><em>ColBERTv2: Effective and Efficient Retrieval via Lightweight Late Interaction</em>（NAACL 2022）— <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2112.01488" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2112.01488</a></li><li><em>Document Ranking with a Pretrained Sequence-to-Sequence Model</em>（Findings of EMNLP 2020）— <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.06713" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2003.06713</a></li><li><em>Is ChatGPT Good at Search? Investigating Large Language Models as Re-Ranking Agents</em>（EMNLP 2023）— <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.09542" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.09542</a></li><li><em>Lost in the Middle: How Language Models Use Long Contexts</em>（TACL 2023）— <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.03172" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.03172</a></li><li><em>Found in the Middle: How Language Models Use Long Contexts Better via Plug-and-Play Positional Encoding</em>（ACL Findings 2024）— <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.16008" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.16008</a></li><li><em>Retrieval Augmented Generation or Long-Context LLMs? A Comprehensive Study and Hybrid Approach</em>（EMNLP 2024 Industry Track）— <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.16833" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.16833</a></li><li><em>Self-RAG: Learning to Retrieve, Generate, and Critique through Self-Reflection</em> — <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.11511" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.11511</a></li><li><em>LLMLingua: Compressing Prompts for Accelerated Inference of Large Language Models</em>（EMNLP 2023）— <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.05736" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.05736</a></li><li><em>RAGAS: Automated Evaluation of Retrieval Augmented Generation</em> — <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.15217" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.15217</a></li><li><em>Judging LLM-as-a-Judge with MT-Bench and Chatbot Arena</em>（NeurIPS 2023 Datasets and Benchmarks Track）— <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.05685" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.05685</a></li></ul><h3 id="工程文档与源码" tabindex="-1">工程文档与源码 <a class="header-anchor" href="#工程文档与源码" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;工程文档与源码&quot;">​</a></h3><ul><li>Anthropic，<em>Introducing Contextual Retrieval</em>（Contextual Embeddings / Contextual BM25、失败率 5.7%→3.7%→2.9%→1.9%、每百万文档 token 约 1.02 美元、50–100 token 上下文前置、块数 5/10/20 的对比）— <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/research/contextual-retrieval" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://www.anthropic.com/research/contextual-retrieval</a></li><li>Elasticsearch 文档，<em>Reciprocal rank fusion</em>（RRF 公式、<code>rank_constant</code> 默认 60、<code>rank_window_size</code> 语义与示例、指向 Cormack SIGIR 2009 论文 PDF）— <a href="https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/reciprocal-rank-fusion" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/rest-apis/reciprocal-rank-fusion</a></li><li>Elasticsearch 文档，<em>Similarity settings</em>（BM25 为默认相似度、<code>k1</code> 默认 1.2、<code>b</code> 默认 0.75、<code>discount_overlaps</code>；LM Dirichlet <code>mu</code> 默认 2000；LM Jelinek Mercer <code>lambda</code> 默认 0.1）— <a href="https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/index-settings/similarity" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/elasticsearch/index-settings/similarity</a></li><li>LangChain 源码，<code>libs/text-splitters/langchain_text_splitters/character.py</code>（默认分隔符 <code>[&quot;\\n\\n&quot;, &quot;\\n&quot;, &quot; &quot;, &quot;&quot;]</code>，各语言分隔符表，Markdown 按 ATX 标题 <code>\\n#{1,6} </code> 切分）— <a href="https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/blob/master/libs/text-splitters/langchain_text_splitters/character.py" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/blob/master/libs/text-splitters/langchain_text_splitters/character.py</a></li></ul><h3 id="产品文档与定价" tabindex="-1">产品文档与定价 <a class="header-anchor" href="#产品文档与定价" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;产品文档与定价&quot;">​</a></h3><p>本表列出本章引用的来源与查看日期（均为近期）。</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>编号</th><th>来源</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>S1</td><td><a href="https://milvus.io/docs/overview.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://milvus.io/docs/overview.md</a></td><td>Milvus 定位、部署模式、索引与检索类型、多租户、Tiered Storage、Apache-2.0</td></tr><tr><td>S2</td><td><a href="https://milvus.io/docs/index.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://milvus.io/docs/index.md</a></td><td>索引类型、稀疏向量与 BM25、量化索引参数</td></tr><tr><td>S3</td><td><a href="https://github.com/milvus-io/milvus%EF%BC%88%E4%BB%93%E5%BA%93%E5%85%83%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://github.com/milvus-io/milvus（仓库元数据）</a></td><td>许可、星标、最近推送</td></tr><tr><td>S4</td><td><a href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/